# my-nuxt-stack

Nuxt 4 starter with Nuxt UI + Tailwind v4, tRPC, BetterAuth, Prisma.

## Stack

- Nuxt 4 + Vue 3 + Nuxt UI + Tailwind v4
- tRPC + vue-query for API
- BetterAuth for auth (magic link + Google OAuth)
- Prisma + PostgreSQL
- Pinia for client state
- Trigger.dev for background jobs

## Conventions

- Vue SFC order: `<script setup>` → `<template>` → `<style>`
- Server business logic lives in `server/services/`, not in pages or tRPC routers
- Background tasks live in `server/trigger/` — dispatch with `tasks.trigger()` from services or tRPC
- Mobile overlays: `MobileBottomSheet` with `AdaptiveOverlay` for desktop (optional; demo shell is centered like my-lara-stack)
- Primary action buttons: use `AppActionButton` or `UButton` `size="lg"` `block`
- Nav config: `app/constants/appNav.ts` (legacy shell components; demo pages use centered layouts)

## UI

- Nuxt UI vs Tailwind split: see [frontend-ui](frontend-ui.mdc)
- Primary action buttons: see [action-buttons](action-buttons.mdc)
- App shell: centered demo layout — `app/layouts/app.vue` (`min-h-svh bg-default`), aligned with my-lara-stack

